It turns out to be a recording of a number of slow swooshing music pieces of the 
sort purported to improve our (some Greek letter) brain waves and thereby 
facilitate something or other, presumably learning in this case.  There is no 
instruction book to say how to insert Lojban into this mix as the target 
subject.  I can't help suspecting -- though I have not checked -- that this 
record, or something very like it, is offered by the same scammers for virtually 
any language you would care to name.





